# Runtime artefacts. ROOT_DIR/data is where the local S3 fallback writes
# uploads and exports and where LangGraph keeps its SQLite checkpoints
# (see backend/app/config.py and backend/app/db.py). None of it is source.
#
# This file exists because it did not, and the directory had grown to 110 MB
# of test detritus -- 799 uploaded fixtures, 2,292 generated exports and an
# 85 MB checkpoint database -- all of it commit-eligible. Uploads are resume
# files; on a real run they are somebody's name, phone number and employment
# history, which is the last thing that should reach a public repository.
data/

# Local SQLite fallback databases.
*.db
